## Model card

- **Name / identity:** Family-level entry, ambiguous between 11B and 90B. Project metadata names both and supplies no unique checkpoint mapping.
- **Description:** Meta image/text assistant family.
- **IDs / access:** `meta-llama/Llama-3.2-11B-Vision-Instruct` and `meta-llama/Llama-3.2-90B-Vision-Instruct`; local inference or provider-specific APIs. Project alias `opencode/llama_3.2_vision_instruct` is not independently verified as a live route.
- **Release / cutoff:** September 25, 2024 / December 2023.
- **Context:** 128K; hosted output limits vary.
- **Modalities:** Text/image input, text output; no verified family-wide tools/JSON contract.
- **Architecture / license:** Dense language backbone plus vision cross-attention adapter; Llama 3.2 Community License.
- **Pricing (2026-10-08):** No single price can be assigned without checkpoint/host selection; no verified Zen Free ID. [Meta card](https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-3.2-90B-Vision-Instruct)

### Raw benchmarks found

Meta instruction-tuned results, separate variants:
| Benchmark | 11B | 90B |
|---|---:|---:|
| GPQA, zero-shot accuracy | 32.8 | 46.7 |
| MMMU validation, CoT | 50.7 | 60.3 |
| MMMU-Pro standard | 33.0 | 45.2 |
| MATH, CoT | 51.9 | 68.0 |
[Official table](https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-3.2-90B-Vision-Instruct).
No blended family score is meaningful. Exact-alias agent, coding and retrieval: no verified public score found. The listed GPQA row is not relabeled Diamond.

### Normalized scores (1–100)

Not scored: verified family benchmarks exist, but the project entry does not resolve to one checkpoint. Choosing 11B or 90B would silently change the research subject; both sets of findings are preserved separately.

